.claude/settings.local.json
package-lock.json
node_modules
# Self-signed dev-only TLS cert/key material — auto-regenerated on demand
# (scripts/serve-dist.js's ensureSelfSignedCert(), MediaMTX's own MoQ
# module), not meant to be checked in. Private keys don't belong in git
# even when they're just local dev certs.
/certs/
/auto.crt
/auto.key
# Everything in dist/ is build output — dist/player/*.js from
# `npm run build:player`'s vite build, dist/index.html copied from
# src/index.html by that same script's build:demo step, dist/server/**
# from `npm run build:server`'s tsc. Nothing under dist/ is hand-maintained
# there directly (see src/index.html for the demo page source).
/dist/
# Local dev config loaded by scripts/loadEnv.js / src/server/loadEnv.ts —
# machine-specific overrides, not meant to be checked in. .env.example
# documents the available keys and stays tracked.
/.env
# Contains a GitHub Packages auth token for @melchi45 (write:packages, for
# `npm publish`) — never commit this.
/.npmrc
